# Security

Full policy: `docs/security.md`. Tenancy: `docs/architecture/tenancy-and-auth.md`.

- Two planes: JWT (humans) vs `X-Api-Key` (ingest only). Never store raw passwords or API keys.
- JWT payload is `sub` only; org is in the URL; check membership every request. Other tenant → **404**.
- Rate limits in Redis. Ingest/login fail closed if Redis is down (**503**).
- Webhook URLs: SSRF checks in `docs/security.md` (no private IPs, no redirects, 5s timeout).
- No secrets in git. Access token not in `localStorage`.
